{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blastr is the <strong>ultimate soundboard</strong> to unleash chaos that all gamers were waiting for.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/a6e66498336e6e9f79e40882e4063dae.poster.avif?t=1764187020\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/a6e66498336e6e9f79e40882e4063dae.webm?t=1764187020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/a6e66498336e6e9f79e40882e4063dae.mp4?t=1764187020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>CHROME PLUGIN</strong> <i>/ The \u201c1-CLICK\u201d Banger</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The days of struggling to find sounds are over. With our <strong>browser extension</strong>, capture any sound on <strong>TikTok</strong>, <strong>Instagram</strong> or <strong>MyInstants</strong>, with <strong>A SINGLE CLICK</strong>. The latest meme you just saw? It's already in your soundboard, ready to be spammed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/584691f02111a908e4e3c775ed84b7f8.poster.avif?t=1764187020\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/584691f02111a908e4e3c775ed84b7f8.webm?t=1764187020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/584691f02111a908e4e3c775ed84b7f8.mp4?t=1764187020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>FAVORITES &amp; BINDS</strong> / <i>Reactivity above all</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your <strong>best sounds</strong> handy thanks to the <strong>favorites bar</strong>. Assign them <strong>keyboard shortcuts (binds)</strong> and draw them faster than your shadow for perfect comedic timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/0c3163661957ac2eecbe2961e20b1547.poster.avif?t=1764187020\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/0c3163661957ac2eecbe2961e20b1547.webm?t=1764187020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/0c3163661957ac2eecbe2961e20b1547.mp4?t=1764187020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>INTEGRATED EDITOR</strong> / <i>Perfect timing</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is a <strong>sound</strong> too long or does it start too late? No problem. Use our <strong>integrated editing tool</strong> to <strong>precisely cut and select the part of the sound you want to play</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/a8ade318de93542f0134f084b67aa772.poster.avif?t=1764187020\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/a8ade318de93542f0134f084b67aa772.webm?t=1764187020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/a8ade318de93542f0134f084b67aa772.mp4?t=1764187020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <strong>MINI MODE</strong> / <i>Discreet and effective</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero distraction. Switch to <strong>mini mode</strong> to display only your <strong>favorites bar</strong>. Perfect for keeping your screen uncluttered. All the power of <strong>Blastr</strong>... in mini.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/f6f1e90986bb51a02cd34ed2fbff5bbf.poster.avif?t=1764187020\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/f6f1e90986bb51a02cd34ed2fbff5bbf.webm?t=1764187020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/f6f1e90986bb51a02cd34ed2fbff5bbf.mp4?t=1764187020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong> / <i>Style above all</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make <strong>Blastr</strong> your <strong>soundboard</strong>! <strong>Organize</strong> your sounds by <strong>tabs</strong>, by <strong>colors</strong>, or both, for a unique style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/extras/462b31269d4c94b49b834fc2a51f676e.avif?t=1764187020\" width=1200 height=156 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>QUESTIONS &amp; ANSWERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q - Does this affect my microphone settings ? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q - Can it destroy my sound card</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q - Quels sont les formats de fichiers compatibles ?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.mp3 / .mp4 / .wav / .ogg / .flac</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q - Can it get me banned in games ?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not for cheating. For spamming obsceneties ( a.k.a gamer words ) like an idiot, yes ( you know what you did you silly billy )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q - Does Blastr affect my recordings ?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to either include Blastr into your audio recordings or not depending on the option you select in input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yes</strong> - <i>Blastr (VB cable output)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No</strong> - <i>Your Microphone</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q - Do I need Blastr launched for my microphone to work</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No but sometimes ( Windows being Windows ) it will bug and you will need to launch Blastr to fix it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows 10 users, see next question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Q - I\u2019m on Windows 10, is it compatible ?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes <strong>BUT</strong> it\u2019s got some minor drawbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1st option</strong>, you will need to leave Blastr running in the background for your microphone to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2nd option</strong>, follow the guide we\u2019ve made on Steam (<i>Community hub</i> / <i>Guides</i>), the drawback - you won\u2019t be able to mute your microphone with Blastr (if you unmute on Blastr you will ear yourself twice)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593120?t=1764187020","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/d1bf3d0ae3436cfd2ff82c8ea083e818012f231c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764187020","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/4eea92a0809d3377e4ec8c98cdcfc98fd45802dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764187020","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593120/4eea92a0809d3377e4ec8c98cdcfc98fd45802dd/c